        "observations": [
          "Signed certification block; initial adoption 2005-08-03 and effectiveness 2005-08-18. Latest printed amendment 2024-08-01 (ZP796) is a clerical FEMA map-adoption text correction.",
          "Map explicitly omits some P-WL waterbody/stream-associated wetlands and P-SL2 along streams through wetlands; water-based boundaries depend on ground locations.",
